## 2. `idr-raise` (new): `include/idr/Transforms/Raise.h`, `lib/Transforms/Raise/{Raise.cpp,Tabulate.cpp,Reduce.cpp,Interchange.cpp,Reads.cpp}`

**Gap it fills (read):** the pin has no raising of a tensor `scf.for` to linalg. It has only `affine-raise-from-memref` (`M/include/mlir/Dialect/Affine/Transforms/Passes.td:400`) and `scf::upliftWhileToForLoop`.

**Passes.td:**
```
